        ecrm:P3_has_note    "One of a pair of supraportes in brown and white on a buff ground. The scene shows a boy with a banner (Ludwig I of Bavaria), a girl (Lola Montez) holding a doll (the Queen of Bavaria), and a kneeling boy (Lola Montez’s father); Silk-screen print, on paper; After drawings by Frau Sattler; Produced by Wilhelm Sattler of Schweinfurt-am-Main; Reproduction from the original by Kurt Weber, Dreye bei Bremen; ca.1840-48."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/45b5639c-5b82-3c8f-a138-4987c7175ee2> .

